    "detailed_description": "&quot;Egg Defense&quot; is a game where players defend against eggs emerging from portals by deploying their units.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><br>Enemy monsters consist of eggs. Eggs emerge from portals and evolve as they move along the path, breaking shells at specific distances.<br>Players can deploy their units to block the eggs. Each unit has unique skills. Units gain mana by attacking, and when mana is charged, they can activate special skills.<br>The game offers opportunities to upgrade character skills every 5 stages. Players can choose one of three cards to upgrade character skills in that stage.<br>With these features, &quot;Egg Defense&quot; offers a casual strategy game with delightful action. Unique character designs and various battle strategies provide players with an enjoyable gaming experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill upgrade</h2><br>Before upgrade<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/00cb08dc196d8d2dcd74a0966b747c1d.poster.avif?t=1719481457\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/00cb08dc196d8d2dcd74a0966b747c1d.webm?t=1719481457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/00cb08dc196d8d2dcd74a0966b747c1d.mp4?t=1719481457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After upgrade<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/c195d8041994bcaa94183ac23672ab51.poster.avif?t=1719481457\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/c195d8041994bcaa94183ac23672ab51.webm?t=1719481457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\